# SYNTHETIC — hand-written from RFC 1939, not a recording.
# The phase-0 capture against a real server has not happened yet.
# STAT, LIST, and DELE in one transaction, then QUIT.

S: +OK POP3 server ready
C: STAT
S: +OK 2 320
C: LIST
S: +OK 2 messages (320 octets)
S: 1 120
S: 2 200
S: .
C: DELE 1
S: +OK message 1 deleted
C: QUIT
S: +OK dewey POP3 server signing off
DONE
